WEBVTT

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.330
You can't come in here!

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.040
Listen lady! I said, you can't com-

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.080
You can let those two through.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:11.500
Take a look.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.330
This definitely wasn't the work of a human.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.420
Pretty sure that's your department.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.380
It's back.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.540
Damn that sick bastard.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.460
We cops are powerless to do anything
once they become monsters.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.540
Can't bring them to justice.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.210
I'll make sure they get what's coming to them.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.040
<b>THE SHRINE MAIDEN IS NEXT</b>

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.380
Mark my words.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.750
Mou dou demo ii ya tte

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.580
Nagedashita kotae

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.380
Hakanaku saki hakanaku chiru kurikaeshi

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.920
Monotarinai mama de

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:15.830
Sou day by day ayunda

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:18.130
Cry mirai kurai

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:22.130
Mada tsukamenai twilight

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:24.500
Don't lose your way

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.670
Yume no himo musunde

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.080
Take me so high

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:32.920
Hashiri dasu brand new life

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.420
Everything I have in my hand

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:39.080
Nanatsu no iro daite

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:40.960
Go ahead, make my day

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:44.380
Kono te de aragae motto!

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:46.830
Everything I have in my hand

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:50.580
Risou kibou kaite

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.170
I won't let you down

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.460
Kono hana sakasete zutto!

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:59.130
Believe myself

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.000
<b>Dearest Wish</b>

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:22.290
Father!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.460
No, you can't...!

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.580
Father?!

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:50.710
Father!

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:01.250
Have no fear, father. I will take your place!

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.920
And carry on the duty of the Hattori family!

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:08.710
There are people who I must protect.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:12.420
My mother, Lady Oka, and my friends.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.210
Ryo?

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.290
Mother!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.210
Is Lady Oka with you?

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.790
No, she's not.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.630
Shoot. That's too bad.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:24.460
You know it's dangerous for you to be out alone.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:28.540
No need to worry. I had Ukon bring me.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:35.500
So, it's almost that time of the year again.

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:38.080
It's been... 5 years.

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.500
I will slay father's killer with my own hands.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.040
Ryo...

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:46.330
That bastard is still out there somewhere
in our world, hiding under a human skin.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:50.630
Remember your duty, you do not get to pick
what Oni to slay or when to slay them.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.750
Tell me. Why didn't you slay Ibara?

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:57.250
It's because...

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:00.460
I'm sorry for being hash on you.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.580
But listen, your father insisted that obeying
the master's orders came above all else.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.630
My understanding is that there is more
to loyalty than blindly following orders.

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.290
Such a foolish child.

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:15.750
Lady Benio?

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.170
Hello?

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.750
Where is Oka?! She's not answering her phone!

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.170
Are you serious?!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.460
Smile!

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:30.750
Woo!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:41.210
<b>Occult</b>

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.210
Oh baby, I'm a guaranteed viral hit now!
Thanks to this gem!

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.040
What are we, chopped liver?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.830
Pardon me a moment. I would like to snap a picture, too!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.130
Huh?

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.040
Looks like your battery is dead.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.790
Maybe they should call this place a "tourist zap"!

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:45.630
You're making a fool of yourself, man.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:48.080
What's got you all worked up today, anyway?

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:50.580
These strange gemstones have
been popping up everywhere.

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:53.460
And paranormal geeks like me are
totally flipping out about it!

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:57.250
It looks just like the one that we found in Okazaki Park.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:58.960
Except that one shattered to pieces...

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.460
What do you think these things
are supposed to be, Kippei?

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:03.710
That's easy!

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:05.500
The sign of an alien invasion!

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.000
Aliens?!

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:08.830
Oh come on, that's ridiculous.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:12.040
Hold up, let me explain! That's just one
of the theories currently floating around.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:17.500
Whenever stuff like this shows up in different places,
I always imagine that you can connect the dots to spell something.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.250
Hey, Ibara.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:17.670
You don't feel the presence of Oni, right?

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:22.630
Like a message, you know? So, I scoured the net for information
and pieced it all together, but I didn't come up with anything solid.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.830
Not a damn thing. It's just a rock.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.630
Perhaps the crystal we found in
the park was different somehow?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.880
As I was saying!

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.420
I bet they were sent here to act as some kind of proxy!

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.540
They're p-rock-sies! Get it?

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.040
Dude!

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:34.670
Oh crap, did I do that?

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.710
Whoa, Oka?!

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.290
Are you all right?

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:44.040
I'm doing a little better now.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:46.540
I'm so sorry. We shouldn't have been goofing around.

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:50.420
Don't be sorry. I was the one who asked
you two to investigate those rocks with me.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:52.500
Yo, Kakeru.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.630
What do you want?

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:55.130
Something weird is heading this way.

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:56.500
Stay alert.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:02.250
Oka?!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:03.250
Big sis?!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.540
Oka! I'm so glad you're okay!

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.000
Miss Benio?!

00:06:07.460 --> 00:06:09.080
Uh, Oka wasn't feeling well!

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.210
And then Ibara told me to stay alert for something!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.630
Calm your ass down, Kakeru.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.170
Oka is being hunted by a Shinja.

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:16.630
What?!

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.040
Lady Oka!

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:24.380
Ryo. I want you to work with Ukon
and protect Oka with White Team.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:25.130
Got that?

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.080
What about the Shinja?

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.580
Issa and I will handle it ourselves.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:29.670
Let's move.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:30.460
Ma'am.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:31.420
Please wait a moment!

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:32.750
I'll go with you!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:34.040
Not happening.

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:36.380
But it murdered my father!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.540
Which is why you can't come.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.460
That obsession only dulls your blade.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.580
Fulfill your duty.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:46.880
Understood...

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.630
Protect Oka with your lives.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.210
Please be careful out there, sis.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.330
I will.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.830
Uh, so I don't understand what's going on...

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.420
Forget it, just come with me.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.750
Freshly baked are the best!

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:02.880
Kippei!

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:05.330
Sorry, man! We gotta take care of something!

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.540
My apologies!

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.880
Yikes, forced overtime...

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:12.920
I was worried.

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:15.790
Oka suddenly fell ill and I wasn't sure what to do.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:19.040
She might have been exposed
to the aura of a dangerous Oni.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.790
There's a real nasty one known for only eating women.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.750
And now it's after her.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.170
So is this the same Oni that killed your father, Ryo?

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:31.460
I'm sorry.

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:36.080
Why're you wussing out all of a sudden, four-eyes?
I thought you wanted revenge.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:36.750
Shut up.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.380
Oh, that hit a nerve.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:43.000
You were so gung-ho about it before.
You even charged in after that huge Oni all by yourself.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:51.460
Except we had to come save your sorry ass after you got
yourself stuck in a trap! I'm not gonna let you forget that!

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:56.040
I acted like a fool. It was all a big mistake.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.460
It wasn't a mistake.

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.170
What?!

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.290
That's the one and only time
I've seen you do something reckless.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.580
And I'm sure it was because your heart needed
to lash out. That's why I think you shou-

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.130
You don't know me!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.290
Don't even pretend.
What the hell is your problem, anyway?!

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:14.670
You never shut up about heroes and saving people,
so why are you trying to push me into this?!

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:18.080
Because to me, it seems like you're torturing yourself.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.920
Mind your own damn business.
And keep your mouth shut.

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:23.290
What's so funny?

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:25.750
I think young people like you should speak their minds.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:26.920
Please drop it.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:29.290
Tell me what you want to do, Ryo.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:31.130
I'm not opposed to turning around.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.750
I will adhere to my duty.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:33.960
Roger that.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:38.040
This friggin' sucks. I wanted a chance to run wild.

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.170
Found it.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.000
Let's do this, Issa.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:43.920
Ma'am.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.830
Yes. That's right.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.880
We're using a different hideout than usual, huh?

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:55.210
Staying in an area with a lot of people
around poses a problem,

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:58.170
because the Oni could possess them
and launch a sneak attack.

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:01.630
But that won't work on us since
we can't be possessed anymore.

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:02.830
Makes sense.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.790
Anyway, can't work on an empty stomach!

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.630
Oh! Dibs on the udon with miso broth!

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:08.130
I would like the Taiwan ramen!

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.960
Sweet, same here!

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.000
Well, someone's grumpy.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.330
Hello all. May I have some too?

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:18.920
I'm pretty hungry right now.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.380
What is that thing?

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.000
Lady Benio!

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:29.830
We've got company.

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:33.250
Is that stone attracting all these Oni?

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:41.130
<b>Mega Max Serving</b>

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:41.130
<b>Yakisoba Noodles</b>

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:42.960
Jeez, Kaede. Overeating is a bad habit, you know.

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:44.540
That one's not mine!

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:45.750
It's actually mine...

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:46.420
Huh?!

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:50.210
<b>Mega Max Serving Yakisoba Noodles</b>

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.420
Guess you really can't judge a book by its cover, huh?

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:54.750
Ryo...

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.290
I'm sorry you have to stay here with me.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:58.880
I know you'd rather...

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.130
Don't worry about it.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:04.750
Making sure that you stay safe is
the duty that we all must uphold.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:08.790
Lady Oka?

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.540
The nether realm is drawing close to here.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.790
Be careful. It's starting to reek of danger.

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:26.210
Unruly creatures of darkness. Return to the time
and place from whence you came.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:35.710
Very strange. There are no traces of the Shinja here.

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:38.130
Dammit!

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:40.080
Oka!

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:45.330
Why hello there, kittens! Thanks for coming to join us.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:46.830
That scared me.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:48.380
It's just that skirt-chasing playboy!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:49.790
Ukon.

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:51.460
Things are about to get busy.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:52.540
Yes.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.500
Seems that we have some party crashers.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.630
It's the nether realm! Oni are coming!

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:00.420
Hey, Ryo.

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:02.500
Can I trust you and White Team to handle things outside?

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:03.710
Of course.

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:06.790
Please stay here and keep Lady Oka and my mother safe.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:12.130
Hell yeah!

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.580
Nothing but a buncha chumps out here!

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:17.000
Where is the Shinja?

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:19.830
Hang on tight, Lady Oka!

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.540
Wait! That Oni is...!

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:22.380
Lady Oka!

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:23.710
It's inside?!

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:25.920
I'll hold them off!

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:26.670
Thanks!

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.790
<b>Mega Max Serving Yakisoba Noodles</b>

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:31.000
Mother!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.380
I'm sorry.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.580
I was just so hungry, you see.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.420
Huh? This really isn't the time...

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:42.710
I truly am sorry.

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:46.130
Ryo...

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:01.250
Shikizakura.

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.250
Shikizakura.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:12.540
Oh, how long I've waited for this moment.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.920
Damn you! Where is my mother?!

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:29.710
Oh please, what kind of question is that?

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:32.250
I can't believe you've been oblivious this whole time!

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:33.290
Huh?

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.880
Ryo... you are the world's biggest moron.

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:41.420
Your mother is dead, obviously!
She has been for 5 years.

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:45.000
Let me tell you, I loved the scream
she made after I impaled her.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:48.630
Even your father cried like a baby.

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:52.960
He got a front row seat... to watching me eat her!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.380
That's absurd...

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.330
Mom! Snap out of it and come back to me!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.580
Just face the facts already.

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:04.040
Pulling the wool over your eyes provided me with
endless entertainment!

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.630
You were such a patsy, always calling me "Mommy!"

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:10.290
That's impossible!

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.460
Because mom... was always...

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:18.710
I'm an Oni, fool. I know exactly what you want me
to say and what you want me to do at all times.

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:21.330
Because I can hear all of your inner desires.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:23.000
No...

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:26.000
This whole time... I've been...

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:32.330
I was ready to keep up the facade for a long time.

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:35.500
But Ryo, you ruined everything.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:40.380
All you had to do was keep
being my adorable little puppet.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.630
But since you've been misbehaving so much lately.

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:45.580
I'm done with you.

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.670
You okay, Ryo? Hang in there!

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:55.960
Ryo?

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.460
That wasn't nice of you...

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.080
Kakeru.

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.630
What? Miss Misuzu?!

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:05.960
That's the Shinja. I never noticed
because it was suppressing its aura.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:07.330
No way...

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:08.330
Look out!

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.330
Stay away from my mother.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.290
Ryo! What's wrong with you?

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:17.540
If I just slay you... this will all blow over.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:20.250
Huh? Did you hit your head or what?

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:24.250
I get killed by Ibara and
then Ryo slays Ibara in a fit of rage.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.540
That's the plan I've cooked up.

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:27.880
After that, all I have to do is consume Ryo's soul.

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:29.790
Then everything falls back into place.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:33.290
That's great. I'm going to become part of you, mom!

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.540
Shit. He's gone off the deep end.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:37.670
Stay away from him! Give Ryo back!

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:41.630
That's a good boy!

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:43.420
How is she even controlling him?!

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:46.670
Four-eyes must've never been
possessed by an Oni before!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.540
Then why was he always so arrogant?!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:53.460
Quit wasting time and kill him already!

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:57.210
Why are Kakeru and Ryo fighting each other?

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:58.420
I don't know!

00:14:58.630 --> 00:14:59.580
Pesky ants!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.000
Uh oh, here it comes!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.210
Let's get some distance and do a pincer attack!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.000
We'll lose if we try to fight this thing head on!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.330
O-okay!

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:08.380
Where did Mr. Ukon go?

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:11.880
Fight seriously or he'll cut right through you!

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.000
I know!

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.040
You ain't going anywhere.

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:29.250
You've fought the Oni for years, but now
you're just gonna surrender and let one eat you?!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:31.290
You can't possibly understand!

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:35.420
I understand enough to know that
this isn't what you really want!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:39.210
I went through the same thing,
and so did Kaede and Haruko!

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:42.420
Oni tried to overwhelm us,
but we fought tooth and nail to come back!

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.830
Don't tell me that you of all people can't do the same!

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:52.880
I fought for all those years to uphold my duty! To honor
my family! But it only amounted to nothing in the end!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:57.750
I strived... to avenge my mother and father.
To defend. But I was tricked.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:00.380
How can I deal with my life being a lie?!

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:03.080
It's fine. You haven't done anything wrong.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.580
It was everyone else who betrayed you.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:09.750
What you must slay now... is this cruel world.

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:11.670
I will...

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.960
Don't throw your life away so willingly!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:24.460
Stop it!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.630
What are you doing?!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.920
What I must slay now...

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.670
...is my own weak heart.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.210
No!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.040
Haruko, watch out!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:41.380
Kaede!

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:43.830
No more running around.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.960
I have to do something.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:47.670
I have to!

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:48.830
Now die!

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:55.920
Ryo!

00:16:57.670 --> 00:16:58.670
Ryo Hattori...

00:16:58.960 --> 00:16:59.830
is born anew.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:01.880
Transform!

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:29.380
Why fight me, Ryo? I was just granting your dearest wish.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:33.250
To make it so you were right and give meaning
to everything you defended over the years.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.460
Now you're just going to throw it away?

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.460
The person I used to be is dead.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:39.500
I must acknowledge the mistakes I've made,

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.500
or else I cannot move forward.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.670
You're a terrible son.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:10.000
I honestly pity this Misuzu woman.

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:12.830
Not only was she eaten by an Oni
because of the man she loved,

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:14.380
but now the son she bore...

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:16.420
is going to cut her to pieces!

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.790
Oni must be... slayed!

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:43.080
I will never forgive you for as long as I live.

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.710
But at the same time...

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:52.210
Even if the whole thing was nothing but a lie...

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:59.000
Protecting you for those 5 years...

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.830
is what sustained me.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.880
I hope you can rest in peace now...

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.750
Father. Mother.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.830
Thank you, Kakeru. I really owe you one.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:29.380
Nah, it was nothing.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:33.580
I thought everything would change
once I had gotten my revenge.

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.130
But honestly...

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:38.210
I don't know. This feels weird.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:41.380
My heart is still as empty as it was before.

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:46.000
You know, I lost my family, my home, and everything.

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:49.170
I just lived on without really knowing
what it even meant to live.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:55.210
But after I met you guys, I learned about what
I'm capable of and that made me really happy.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.130
That was the first time I felt content with myself.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:01.580
So I figured it would be good for you
to face your problems head on, too.

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:06.290
I see, you managed to fill the hole
in your heart all by yourself.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:09.210
I'm sorry, Kakeru.

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:12.170
I never even tried to understand the depth of the
sorrow you were struggling with.

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:13.380
No, don't apologize!

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.500
Nobody will experience this pain again. It ends with me!

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.580
This is where we make our stand!

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.580
We will prevent any more people
from having to suffer like this!

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.670
Right! Let's do it!

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:27.130
Are you okay, Kaede?

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:28.830
No worries, I'm just fine!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.040
Ugh, ow...

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.130
Kaede, I'm so sorry.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:34.790
I panicked and froze up...

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.080
I'm just glad that you didn't get hurt, Haruko!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.830
Kaede went out of her way to protect me, but I...

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:42.460
Anybody hurt?

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:45.130
Hope you're okay, kittens.

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:56.710
Ima kono shunkan ga owaranai you ni

00:20:57.000 --> 00:21:00.710
Nan juu nen saki made tsuzukimasu you ni

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:07.130
Kirei na fuku datte kirenaku natte

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:11.540
Watashi dake ga inakunatta sekai de

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:15.710
Ano hi nigate datta cider

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:17.920
Kieta semi no koe

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.250
Unmei ni shizundeku

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:23.290
Mogaki kata mo wakarazu ni

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:28.130
Watashi no koto nante mietenai mitai de

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:32.000
Sakarau ki mo okinainda yo

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:37.670
Anata ga te o hiite kureta toki

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:41.540
Mieta kirei na sekai no iro

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:44.170
Sakura no saku kisetsu ni

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:48.330
Mujaki ni warau sore ni tsurarete

00:21:48.920 --> 00:21:52.420
Kawaranai koto nante nai

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:56.420
Kanashii mirai datte kitto sou desho

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:23.750
I'll seal the nether realm shut.

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:28.920
There's another Oni!

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:39.250
Oh boy, I'm pretty plastered right now.

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:41.380
Jeez, dad! Take it easy on the drinks!

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:43.130
But alcohol tastes so damn good.

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:44.790
Y-yeah, I'm sure it does.

00:22:44.790 --> 00:22:46.000
Now the room is spinning.

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:47.790
Oh no, please don't say that!

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Escape</b>

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:49.130
Next time: Escape

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:50.170
More like escapism.
